[{"id":"playwright-project-evidence","type":"basic","priority":2,"deck":"Playwright","tags":["项目实战","证据"],"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/","articles":[{"articleKey":"_posts/learn-topic/playwright/Playwright(十二)项目实战.md","articleTitle":"Playwright(十二)项目实战","articlePath":"posts/8141684d/"}],"articleIndex":1,"articleCount":4,"questionHtml":"\u003cp>三浏览器测试全部通过，是否能证明线上业务一定正常？\u003c/p>\n","answerHtml":"\u003cp>不能，只能证明指定提交在指定测试环境和浏览器矩阵中通过。\u003c/p>\n","explanationHtml":"\u003cp>本地、CI、测试环境和线上是不同证据层。未执行的线上路径必须保持 NOT VERIFIED，不能由 CI 结果推导。\u003c/p>\n","multiple":false,"correct":[],"options":[]}]